stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open
    Open --> Stopped: message_stop
    Open --> Broken: 提前网络失败
    Stopped --> SuccessClean: 正常收尾
    Stopped --> SuccessUnclean: 网络失败且无后继等待
